OL,3,GNEWSACould lack of tourist tax benefit
OL,4,AGloucestershire?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitality businesses in
OL,7,FGloucestershire say the lack of a
OL,8,Ftourism tax in the county could give it
OL,9,Fa competitive edge when it comes to
OL,10,Fattracting visitors.
OL,12,FThe government's proposed overnight
OL,13,Fvisitor levy would allow councils and
OL,14,Fregional authorities to charge
OL,15,Fholidaymakers an additional fee for
OL,16,Ftheir accommodation, raising money to
OL,17,Fbe spent on local services.
OL,19,FBut Gloucestershire is not currently
OL,20,Feligible to introduce the charge due to
OL,21,Fthe set-up of local government there.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
