OL,3,GNEWSACould lack of tourist tax benefit
OL,4,AGloucestershire?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNaomi Hands, director of the Speech
OL,7,FHouse Hotel in the Forest of Dean, said
OL,8,Fintroducing the tourist tax would add
OL,9,Fmore pressure onto an already
OL,10,Fstruggling industry.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
